      "defect_type": "Type II",
      "severity": 2,
      "explanation": "The proposal's remedy is a transfer of permitting and enforcement authority, but the available notice does not explain in operational terms why the transfer will maintain equivalent protection under Alaska's staffing, funding, contractor, and enforcement conditions.",
