          "section": "IV.C Comprehensive Evaluation",
          "quote_or_absence": "The notice concludes that Alaska meets all applicable requirements, but the available text does not display the capacity and implementation findings that connect the stated legal equivalence to the practical transfer."
        }
      ],
      "comment_leverage": "Ask EPA to publish the capacity and equivalence findings and to use conditions, milestones, or staged approval if readiness is not demonstrated."
    },
